"hero": "\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\">{{ppp:breadcrumbs}}<span class=\"eyebrow\">Ellis Services Group · Perth</span><h1>24-Hour Emergency Electrician Perth</h1><aside class=\"intent-safety\" data-intent-safety><p><strong>Electrical danger comes before booking.</strong> For a shock or tingling tap, keep clear and call <a href=\"tel:131351\">Western Power 13 13 51</a>. For a life-threatening emergency or fire, call <a href=\"tel:000\">000</a>. <a href=\"https://www.westernpower.com.au/issues-enquiries/reporting-incidents-and-emergencies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Official emergency guidance</a>. For loss of supply, check <a href=\"https://www.westernpower.com.au/issues-enquiries/reporting-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Western Power outage reporting</a> before assuming an internal circuit fault.</p></aside><p class=\"expanded-lead\">24-hour emergency electrical repairs in Perth for urgent faults in private installations. Call with the location and observable problem to confirm the response and quoted work; shock, fire and network hazards need the official safety route first.</p><p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=emergency-electrician-perth.html\">Arrange a visit &amp; quote</a></p><p class=\"expanded-hours\">Routine service hours: 09:00–21:00, seven days a week. 24-hour emergency repairs are available; call to confirm attendance arrangements and the quoted emergency work. No arrival time is guaranteed.</p><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"expanded-toc\"><a href=\"#service-scope\">Service scope</a><a href=\"#service-scenarios\">Common situations</a><a href=\"#service-quote\">Process &amp; quote</a><a href=\"#service-faq\">FAQs</a></nav></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"sections": [
